WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.970
When to stop compressions.

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:15.453
Continue until paramedics or an in-facility emergency team take over, the AED says it is analysing, charging or about to shock, or the casualty wakes or resumes normal breathing.

00:00:15.453 --> 00:00:18.483
The lay path does not add a pulse check.
